<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">Ref No: {{{Case.Case_Number__c}}}<br />
<br />
Hi&nbsp;{{{Case.First_Name__c}}},
<p>Thank you for getting in touch with the Qantas Customer Care team to request a letter for your insurance company.<br />
<br />
<strong>Please contact the issuing agent</strong><br />
<br />
We can only provide a letter confirming the cancellation of bookings made directly with Qantas.<br />
<br />
This means that if your ticket was issued by a third party, such as a travel agent or another carrier, any information about the fare paid, ticket cancellation and any subsequent refund will need to be provided by the issuing agent.<br />
<br />
Therefore, you’ll need to contact them directly. I hope this helps.</p>
</body>
</html>